    {
      "extracted_at": "2026-08-10T14:27:51Z",
      "payload": {
        "chunks": [
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "Worldwide oil-equivalent production of 3.099 million barrels per day in 2021 was up approximately 1 percent from 2020.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Upstream Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "At the end of 2021, the company had a refining network capable of processing 1.8 million barrels of crude oil per day. Average crude oil distillation capacity utilization was 82 percent in 2021 and 76 percent in 2020.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Downstream Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1",
              "update_type": "confirmation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "The company estimates its average worldwide oil-equivalent production in 2022 to be flat to down three percent compared to 2021 assuming a Brent crude oil price of $60 per barrel and excluding the impact of asset sales that may close in 2022. Excluding contract expirations and 2022 asset sales, 2022 production is expected to increase by two to five percent compared to 2021.",
            "entity_name": "CVX 2022 Production Outlook",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1",
              "update_type": "confirmation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "Chevron is one of the largest producers in the Permian Basin with a production outlook of more than one million barrels of net oil equivalent production per day by 2025.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Permian Basin 2025 Production Target",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In July 2021, the company sold its 37.5 percent nonoperated interest in the Papa-Terra oil field.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Divestiture of Brazil Papa-Terra Oil Field Interest",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In April 2021, further to the exercise of a preemptive right by its joint venture partner, the company signed an agreement to divest its 40 percent operated interest in OML 86 and OML 88. This sale is subject to customary closing conditions.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Agreement to Divest Nigeria OML 86 and OML 88",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In January 2022, Chevron announced its intention to begin the process of a planned and orderly transition that will lead to an exit from the country.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Myanmar Operations Exit Announcement",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "Chevron was the successful bidder in an April 2021 bid round for a 40 percent-owned and operated working interest in Block 5 and signed the production-sharing contract (PSC) in October 2021.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Suriname Block 5 PSC Acquisition",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "The Block 0 partners and National Concessionaire signed an extension for an additional 20 years in December 2021. This extension to 2050 is subject to legislative approvals.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Angola Block 0 Concession Extension to 2050",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "The Chevron-operated Rokan PSC in Sumatra expired in August 2021.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Indonesia Rokan PSC Expiration",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "Chevron aims to lower the carbon intensity of its traditional oil and gas operations and grow lower carbon businesses in renewable fuels, hydrogen, carbon capture and offsets. To grow its lower carbon businesses, Chevron plans to target sectors of the economy where emissions are harder to abate or that cannot be easily electrified, while leveraging the company's capabilities, assets and customer relationships.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Lower Carbon Business Strategy",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "Chevron completed front-end engineering and design (FEED) in second quarter 2021 on a carbon capture project for emissions reduction from the gas turbines in one of our California co-generation facilities. This project leverages two innovative technologies—carbon dioxide concentration and carbon capture—and has the potential to scale across our full fleet of turbines. A final investment decision for this project is expected in third quarter 2022, with anticipated start-up in 2024.",
            "entity_name": "CVX California Carbon Capture Project at Co-Generation Facility",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "Chevron's Permian operations have also demonstrated continual progress on its lower carbon and water goals, consistently ranking among the best Permian operators for methane emissions intensity, routine flaring, and water handling (utilizing 99 percent brackish or recycled sources).",
            "entity_name": "CVX Permian Basin Methane Intensity and Water Recycling Goals",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "Chevron believes innovative solutions to the most complex challenges emerge when diverse people, ideas, and experiences come together in an inclusive environment. Chevron reinforces the values of diversity and inclusion through recruitment and talent development, equitable selection processes, community partnerships and supplier diversity.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Diversity and Inclusion Programs",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          }
        ],
