    {
      "extracted_at": "2026-08-10T14:32:19Z",
      "payload": {
        "chunks": [
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In October 2021, the company closed its acquisition of an equity interest in American Natural Gas LLC (now Beyond6, LLC) and its network of 60 CNG retail sites, in order to meet customers' needs beyond California.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Acquisition of Beyond6 LLC Equity Interest",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "Chevron acquired all of the outstanding common units of Noble Midstream Partners LP not already owned by Chevron or any of its affiliates in May 2021.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Acquisition of Noble Midstream Partners Outstanding Common Units",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "The new energies organization was formed in 2021 and is designed to advance the company's strategy by bringing together dedicated resources focused on growing new lower carbon businesses that have the potential to scale.",
            "entity_name": "Chevron New Energies Organization Formation",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "In June 2021, the company announced its first branded compressed natural gas (CNG) site as part of its plan to have more than 30 CNG sites in California supplied with RNG by 2025.",
            "entity_name": "CVX California CNG RNG 30-Plus Sites by 2025 Plan",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "In December 2021, Chevron joined the Sea Cargo Charter, a benchmark initiative for responsible shipping activities, transparent greenhouse gas reporting, and improved decision making in line with the United Nations' decarbonization targets.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Sea Cargo Charter Membership",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "In third quarter 2021, the refinery began co-processing about 2,000 barrels per day of bio-feedstock, producing renewable diesel at a diesel hydrotreating unit as well as a batch of sustainable aviation fuel at a fluid catalytic cracking unit.",
            "entity_name": "CVX El Segundo Renewable Diesel and SAF Co-Processing Program",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "Its initial focus will include commercialization opportunities in hydrogen, CCUS, and carbon offsets. These businesses are expected to support the company's efforts to reduce its greenhouse gas emissions and are also expected to become high-growth opportunities with the potential to generate accretive returns.",
            "entity_name": "CVX New Energies Hydrogen CCUS and Carbon Offsets Commitment",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": "2022-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1",
              "update_type": "confirmation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
